repository-code: "https://github.com/1337isnot1337/solved-conjectures"
url: "https://github.com/1337isnot1337/solved-conjectures"
abstract: >-
  Three unrefereed research notes: a counterexample to the published
  L-solitaire limit-shape conjecture, a counterexample to Pham's original
  exact denominator-degree conjecture, and an explicit non-spider counterexample
  to Li's chromatic-symmetric-function coefficient-sign prediction.
  Includes exact proofs, certificates, and reproducible Python verification.
